# Knowledge Sync Candidate

这里保存候选长期知识，不直接修改 `knowledge/`。每个候选先写入当前 Change 下的 `knowledge-candidates/`，并在 `change.yaml` 的 `knowledge_sync.entries` 中登记。

## Entry Schema

```yaml
knowledge_sync:
  status: candidate
  entries:
    - id: FLOW-EXAMPLE-001
      action: add # add | replace
      candidate: changes/active/<change-id>/knowledge-candidates/example.md
      target: knowledge/flows/example.md
      index_entry:
        title: Example flow
        type: flow # fact | flow | decision | debt | critical-surface | glossary
        evidence_status: verified
        architecture_status: current
        domains: [solver]
        keywords: [state, lifecycle]
        related: []
```

