## Review Boundary

批准实现计划不等于批准长期知识。标准流程：

```text
生成 candidate
→ harness.py render-knowledge-diff
→ 用户审核完整 diff
→ harness.py promote-knowledge --reviewed-by ... --evidence ...
```

